The bug was caused by the improper handling of D-Bus property updates due to the removal of the `g_dbus_interface_skeleton_flush()` call from the `service_install_notify` function. This led to property updates being aggregated in an idle loop, resulting in the loss of status update information when multiple updates occurred before a notification was sent out.

